UID:january-exception-2026@jajpo.com
DTSTAMP:20261105T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270201
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270202
SUMMARY:Last day to file and pay in full and skip the January 2026 estimate
 d payment
DESCRIPTION:If you file your 2026 return and pay all the tax you owe by tod
 ay\, you do not have to make the January estimated payment for 2026. See t
 he JAJPO guide to quarterly estimated taxes. https://jajpo.com/taxes/quart
 erly-estimated-taxes/ General information\, not tax advice. Dates can chan
 ge\, for example after a disaster declaration\; check IRS.gov.
URL:https://jajpo.com/taxes/quarterly-estimated-taxes/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Last day to file and pay in full and skip the January 2026 esti
 mated payment
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
